{code:java}
 INSERT INTO tbl REPLACE whereClause identifierList{code}
to the spark SQL, as the equivalent of [dataframe.overwrite()|https://github.com/apache/spark/blob/35d00df9bba7238ad4f409999617fae4d04ddbfd/sql/core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/sql/DataFrameWriterV2.scala#L163] command. 

 

