The problem happens only if I do not perform datch.DF.persist inside foreachBatch.
{code:java}
StreamingQuery query = sessionUpdates
        .writeStream()
        .outputMode("update")
        .foreachBatch((VoidFunction2<Dataset<SessionUpdate>, Long>) (batchDf, v2) -> {
