For example:
Query:
{code:java}
SELECT * FROM VALUES(0) t(x) JOIN LATERAL (SELECT rand(0) + x AS y); {code}
Result:
{code:java}
org.apache.spark.sql.AnalysisException: nondeterministic expressions are only allowed in
Project, Filter, Aggregate or Window{code}

