{code}

The code below portraits the issue:
{code:sql}
spark-sql> CREATE TEMP VIEW v1 AS SELECT 16777215.0f AS f;
spark-sql> SELECT * FROM v1;
1.6777215E7
spark-sql> SELECT CAST(f AS TIMESTAMP) FROM v1;
1970-07-14 07:20:15
spark-sql> CACHE TABLE v1;
spark-sql> SELECT * FROM v1;
1.6777215E7
