$ pbpaste | base64 --decode
aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa%

$ pbpaste | base64 --decode
base64: stdin: (null): error decoding base64 input stream
